      ],
      "source": "https://hometownhistorymaps.com/pages/history-of-green-valley-illinois",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A 1997 quasquicentennial volume titled “Green Valley, Illinois, Celebrates 125 Years, 1872‑1997” chronicles the town’s first 125 years.",
